OL,3,GNEWSABowel cancer cases in under-50s at
OL,4,Arecord high
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of people under the age of
OL,7,F50 being diagnosed with bowel cancer in
OL,8,FScotland has reached a record high,
OL,9,Fwith almost 290 new cases in 2024, new
OL,10,Ffigures show.
OL,12,FBowel cancer is the fourth most common
OL,13,Fcancer in Scotland and is more often
OL,14,Fdiagnosed older people, with those over
OL,15,F50 offered screening in an attempt to
OL,16,Fdetect it early.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
