OL,3,GNEWSABowel cancer cases in under-50s at
OL,4,Arecord high
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, new figures from Public Health
OL,7,FScotland, external show incidence has
OL,8,Fjumped by 38% in the under-50s over the
OL,9,Fpast decade, with rates among younger
OL,10,Fwomen increasing by 56% in comparison
OL,11,Fwith 24% in younger men.
OL,13,FLast month, the Scottish government
OL,14,Fasked the UK National screening
OL,15,Fcommittee to look at lowering the age
OL,16,Ffor bowel screening to 45, to target
OL,17,Fyounger patients.
